s="k_23d601a_editionTitle">Starplayer.</h2><div class="k_4b0a5fa_tags"><span>Glass mousepads</span><span>In development</span></div><dl class="k_4b0a5fa_specs"><div><dt>DESIGN FORMAT</dt><dd>490 × 420 <small>mm</small></dd></div><div><dt>EDITION</dt><dd>01<!-- --> / <!-- -->07</dd></div></dl><p class="k_4b0a5fa_description">Game worlds meet the visual language of records. One artwork per edition, in a collection of character and album-inspired design studies.</p><button class="k_4b0a5fa_more" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog">see more<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><a class="k_4b0a5fa_primaryButton" href="/#newsletter">Get release updates<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="k_4b0a5fa_conceptNote">Design preview. Final product details to be announced.</p></article><div class="k_4b0a5fa_stageBottom k_23d601a_controls"><div class="k_4b0a5fa_viewControl" role="group" aria-label="Viewing angle"><button type="button" aria-pressed="true">DESK VIEW</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">TOP VIEW</button></div><div class="k_4b0a5fa_pagination k_23d601a_pagination"><button type="button" aria-label="Previous mousepad" disabled="">←</button><span aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">1<!-- --> <!-- -->of<!-- --> <!-- -->7<span class="k_4b0a5fa_srOnly">: <!-- -->Starplayer.</span></span><button type="button" aria-label="Next mousepad">→</button></div><span class="k_4b0a5fa_help">DRAG TO EXPLORE / 7 INDIVIDUAL EDITIONS</span></div></section><section class="k_23d601a_notes" aria-label="KIKORA / DESIGN STUDY"><p>Independent concept artwork. No official game or recording-artist collaboration is implied.</p><span>Artwork<!-- --> / <!-- -->STARPLAYER.</span></section><dialog class="k_6b28d44_dialog" aria-labelledby="_R_r_-title"><div class="k_6b28d44_shell"><header class="k_6b28d44_header"><span class="k_6b28d44_eyebrow">KIKORA / Product notes</span><button type="button" class="k_6b28d44_close" autofocus="" aria-label="Close product details"><span class="k_6b28d44_closeText">Close</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 6 12 12M6 18 18 6"></path></svg></button></header><div class="k_6b28d44_layout"><div class="k_6b28d44_main"><div class="k_6b28d44_intro"><p class="k_6b28d44_index">01 / GLASS — COVERS</p><h2 id="_R_r_-title">Starplayer.</h2><p>One artwork. One edition. A new way to set the tone.</p></div><figure class="k_6b28d44_visual"><div class="k_6b28d44_glassPad " aria-hidden="true"><div class="album-art-image album-art-reyna"><img alt="Reyna fan art in violet light against a vivid red album-cover background" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 85vw, 55vw" draggable="false" src="{{ 'kikora-images-album-concept-reyna.webp' | asset_url }}" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;inset:0;color:transparent" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><span class="album-art-title">STARPLAYER.</span><span class="album-art-caption">REYNA / CHARACTER REMIX CONCEPT 001</span></div></div><figcaption>Starplayer.<span>490 × 420 mm design</span></figcaption></figure><div class="k_6b28d44_tabList" role="tablist" aria-label="Starplayer. information"><button type="button" role="tab" id="_R_r_-tab-specs" aria-controls="_R_r_-panel-specs" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" class="k_6b28d44_tab">Specs<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="_R_r_-tab-story" aria-controls="_R_r_-panel-story" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="k_6b28d44_tab">Story<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="_R_r_-tab-faq" aria-controls="_R_r_-panel-faq" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="k_6b28d44_tab">FAQ<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div><section role="tabpanel" id="_R_r_-panel-specs" aria-labelledby="_R_r_-tab-specs" tabindex="0" class="k_6b28d44_panel"><p class="k_6b28d44_panelLead">The details are in development.</p><dl class="k_6b28d44_specs"><div><dt>Category</dt><dd>Glass mousepads</dd></div><div><dt>Collection</dt><dd>Cover series</dd></div><div><dt>Edition</dt><dd>Starplayer.</dd></div><div><dt>Design dimensions</dt><dd>490 × 420 mm</dd></div><div><dt>Thickness</dt><dd>To be confirmed</dd></div><div><dt>Surface &amp; base</dt><dd>To be confirmed</dd></div><div><dt>Status</dt><dd>In development</dd></div></dl><p class="k_6b28d44_specNote">Final specifications, pricing, and release timing will be shared as development progresses.</p></section><section role="tabpanel" id="_R_r_-panel-story" aria-labelledby="_R_r_-tab-story" hidden="" tabindex="0" class="k_6b28d44_panel"><p class="k_6b28d44_panelLead">A surface with its own sound.</p><p>Each Cover series mousepad is conceived as its own edition: one artwork, one visual identity. Music and album design guide the atmosphere, while final artwork and production specifications are still in development.</p><p class="k_6b28d44_storySignoff">KIKORA / Objects for your everyday.</p></section><section role="tabpanel" id="_R_r_-panel-faq" aria-labelledby="_R_r_-tab-faq" hidden="" tabindex="0" class="k_6b28d44_panel k_6b28d44_faq"><details open=""><summary>What does a Cover edition mean?</summary><p>One artwork defines each edition. The direction draws on music and album visuals; the artwork shown here is a concept study, not an announced official collaboration.</p></details><details><summary>What are the confirmed specifications?</summary><p>The design dimensions are 490 × 420 mm. Glass thickness, surface finish, and base construction are still to be confirmed.</p></details><details><summary>How can I hear about the release?</summary><p>This product direction is in development.<!-- --> Pricing and release timing have not been announced. Visit the <a href="/#newsletter">release newsletter</a> for future updates.</p></details></section></div><aside class="k_6b28d44_aside" aria-label="Product overview"><span class="k_6b28d44_eyebrow">KIKORA / <!-- -->Starplayer.</span><h3>Set your own tone.</h3><p class="k_6b28d44_as